---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P7｜Future Watch｜AI Platform Evolution｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P7</div>
    <h1>下一個真正值得驗證的訊號</h1>
    <p>
      研究不是猜測未來，而是持續追蹤
      技術是否跨越下一個證據門檻。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="map-card">
      <span class="tag">WATCH 01</span>
      <h2>驗證</h2>
      <p>
        技術是否由研發進入客戶驗證？
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <span class="tag">WATCH 02</span>
      <h2>導入</h2>
      <p>
        是否進入實際製程或產品設計？
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <span class="tag">WATCH 03</span>
      <h2>量產</h2>
      <p>
        是否形成可觀察的產能與營收？
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <span class="tag">WATCH 04</span>
      <h2>擴散</h2>
      <p>
        是否由單一客戶擴展至更多 AI 平台？
      </p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">WATCH FRAMEWORK</div>
        <h2>四道門檻</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="watch-flow">

      <div>
        <strong>R&D</strong>
        <span>技術開發</span>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <strong>Validation</strong>
        <span>客戶驗證</span>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <strong>Qualification</strong>
        <span>供應鏈認證</span>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <strong>Production</strong>
        <span>量產</span>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <strong>Scale</strong>
        <span>規模化</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <article class="insight-card">

    <span class="tag">J INSIGHT</span>

    <h2>真正有價值的訊號，通常不是第一個新聞。</h2>

    <p>
      而是當一項技術從「有人談」，
      逐步走到「有人驗證、有人導入、有人量產」。
    </p>

    <p class="warning">
      ※ Future Watch 為研究追蹤框架，不代表特定技術或公司必然成功。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>

<nav class="research-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p6">← P6 · Investment Matrix</a>
  <a href="../">Vol.01 目錄</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p8">P8 · Methodology →</a>
</nav>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.watch-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;border:1px solid #344457;background:#101822;border-radius:18px;padding:30px}
.watch-flow div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:15px;border:1px solid #354457;border-radius:9px;background:#151f2b}
.watch-flow span{font-size:12px;color:#7f8d9d}
.watch-flow b{color:#7188a0}
.insight-card{border:1px solid #40536a;background:rgba(18,27,38,.82);border-radius:18px;padding:34px}
.insight-card h2{font-size:31px;margin:12px 0 20px}
.insight-card p{color:#aeb9c6;max-width:850px}
.warning{font-size:12px!important;color:#7f8d9d!important}
.research-nav{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px 70px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.research-nav a{color:#b8c8d9;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:800px){.watch-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}.watch-flow b{display:none}.insight-card{padding:25px}.research-nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
